**What I changed:**

1. **`src/limiter.ts`** — Implemented `RateLimiter` with the existing constructor signature preserved (capacity, refillPerSecond, now, all readonly). Added private state `tokens` and `last`, a private `refill()` step, `tryTake(n)` (refusing `n > capacity` immediately, refilling, and subtracting only on success), and `get available()` that refills then returns tokens (fractional allowed). No exports added beyond `RateLimiter`.

